  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Programme for Out-of-School Adolescents in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced equitable and inclusive access to quality basic education and lifelong learning for out of school adolescents in Tanzania&#xd559;&#xad50; &#xbc16; &#xccad;&#xc18c;&#xb144;&#xb4e4;(IPOSA &#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xc878;&#xc5c5;&#xc0dd;)&#xc758; &#xc0dd;&#xd65c; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc9c0;&#xc2dd;&#xacfc; &#xae30;&#xc220; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;, IPOSA &#xc878;&#xc5c5;&#xc0dd;&#xc758; &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xc9c0;&#xc704; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Newly starting operating IPOSA centers supported by KOICAs fund, Trained IPOSA instructors, Out of school youth enrolled in and regularly attend IPOSA classes, IPOSA Empowerment Club from the IPOSA graduates, IPOSA graduates access internships or apprenticeships, Technical backstopping to IAE and PO RALG</narrative>
  </description>
